{
  "_id": "dmgTreasure00000",
  "name": "宝藏",
  "pages": [
    {
      "sort": 100000,
      "name": "引言",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "8b89AU6dQR6bti27",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": false,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>冒险者们会为了许多事物而奋战，包括但不限于荣誉、知识与正义。但有的冒险者会更青睐一些具体的东西——宝藏。本章将会展示从钱币至魔法物品所有形式的宝藏。</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.dnd5e-collection-2024.dungeon-masters-guide.JournalEntry.dmgCh7ArtHandout.JournalEntryPage.G2g8KjUZGQTEj1Qf cite=false]</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
